    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_trainer_01a",
      "hash64": "033215E8AA805C80",
      "text": "怎麼？[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳又來啦！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_26",
      "hash64": "93117A305CF60F00",
      "text": "呃啊～！\\n找不到！怎麼會沒有！！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_27",
      "hash64": "93117B305CF610B3",
      "text": "我的錢包……在哪啊～！！！！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_28",
      "hash64": "931188305CF626CA",
      "text": "再這樣下去，\\n精選商品就要被別人買走了……[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_29",
      "hash64": "931189305CF6287D",
      "text": "……嗚嗚嗚。[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_trainer_01b",
      "hash64": "033218E8AA806199",
      "text": "大哥，請冷靜！\\n我現在就去跑一趟。一定找得到的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_trainer_02",
      "hash64": "0B79F51B0482ECC8",
      "text": "哎呀，怎麼啦？\\n如果是有事要找海岱大哥，\\r\\n他現在正忙著呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_trainer_03",
      "hash64": "0B79F61B0482EE7B",
      "text": "不論是誰，要是想礙事的話，\\n我這個頭號弟子是不會放過的……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_trainer_04",
      "hash64": "0B79FB1B0482F6FA",
      "text": "都已經告訴[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳我們這～麼忙了，\\n……[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳還有事想找我們？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_select_a",
      "hash64": "3ECD48AC469CDCAC",
      "text": "有事！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_select_b",
      "hash64": "3ECD4BAC469CE1C5",
      "text": "沒事……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_trainer_05",
      "hash64": "0B79FC1B0482F8AD",
      "text": "那[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳還不快回去！\\n我們可是很忙的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_trainer_06",
      "hash64": "0B79F91B0482F394",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳這小孩子真不聽話！\\n就讓[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳稍微安靜一點吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_trainer_07",
      "hash64": "0B79FA1B0482F547",
      "text": "我的媽呀！\\n輸得連私房錢都沒啦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_01",
      "hash64": "930AF5305CF0C153",
      "text": "嘿！吃飽了沒……\\n這騷動是怎麼回事……？[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_trainer_08",
      "hash64": "0B79EF1B0482E296",
      "text": "海、海岱大哥！\\n是這小孩子[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]他她……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_02",
      "hash64": "930AF6305CF0C306",
      "text": "怎麼會有客人來找我這個\\n丟了錢包，身無分文的傢伙……？\\r\\n到底有何貴幹呀……？[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "54C29DBBFD75281A",
      "text": "錢包！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "54C29CBBFD752667",
      "text": "你忘了這個！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_system_01",
      "hash64": "C22350BAFFC104CD",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]將海岱的錢包\\n交給了道館館主！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_03",
      "hash64": "930AF7305CF0C4B9",
      "text": "呃啊～！？\\n是我的錢包！！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_04",
      "hash64": "930AF8305CF0C66C",
      "text": "啥！是道館櫃台的人\\n要[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳送來給我的啊！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_05",
      "hash64": "930AF9305CF0C81F",
      "text": "哇、哈、哈！這真是救了我一把！\\n謝謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳跑了這麼一趟路！！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_06",
      "hash64": "930AFA305CF0C9D2",
      "text": "啊～還有，我家的小伙子\\n給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳添麻煩了，抱歉啊！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_07",
      "hash64": "930AFB305CF0CB85",
      "text": "在漬沁鎮出名的[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]拍賣會[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]上\\n有個我們無論如何都想買的東西。[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_08",
      "hash64": "930AFC305CF0CD38",
      "text": "所以兩個人的情緒\\n都有點兒激動。[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_shop_01",
      "hash64": "4C49FA89878568CE",
      "text": "來喲～！走過路過不要錯過！\\n今天的壓軸商品上場嘍！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_09",
      "hash64": "930AFD305CF0CEEB",
      "text": "嗯……？[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_shop_02",
      "hash64": "4C49F9898785671B",
      "text": "這就是今天的精選商品！\\n豐緣地區出產的傳說的海帶！\\r\\n來喲！看一看！瞧一瞧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_10",
      "hash64": "930E7A305CF3D929",
      "text": "呃啊！呃啊～！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_11",
      "hash64": "930E79305CF3D776",
      "text": "不用摸也看得出\\n那營養充沛的彈力！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_12",
      "hash64": "930E78305CF3D5C3",
      "text": "那反射光線後\\n耀眼奪目的色澤！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_13",
      "hash64": "930E77305CF3D410",
      "text": "以及那藏也藏不住的\\n新鮮芳醇的大海氣味！！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
